{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028111219779-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028112120\"/><p>廈門灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（28日）宣布，由於大浪關係，西貢區的廈門灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:06.456651+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:12:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.466046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:30.892396+00:00","content_hash":"d5ca4555281cb11fa844a407bf5a7fb0d79a65b0f632d4efed524e564e5d61ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:06.456651+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}